The suspension is pleaded primarily on two grounds; that the petitioner was deprived of exercising his right under Section 13 (2) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act due to more than 10 Sanjay vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 28 January, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/138940043/
